# =============================================================================
# Unreal Engine 5.8 + Ashen Oath Git Ignore Policy
# =============================================================================

# Build outputs and engine generated folders
**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/
**/Build/

# Visual Studio & IDE artifacts
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.vcxproj
*.vcxproj.filters
*.vcxproj.user

# Temporary caches and archives
**/.cache/
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.log
*.tmp
compile_commands.json

# Content directory binary assets (uasset/umap large binaries managed via LFS if needed)
# Uncomment if managing source/docs only:
# **/Content/
